# panel-src phase 10 — Holoo integration hardening (Nov 2026, post-Task-65
# spec-compliance audit against the owner's integration specification)
#
# Five targeted fixes, all server-side, NO schema/DDL/API-contract change:
#  * src/lib/holoo.ts — holooSafeError now passes plain-string errors
#    through (they are OUR internal safe messages, e.g. the invoice-
#    without-linked-customer notice) instead of collapsing them into an
#    uninformative [unknown] in the sync log (spec §9 error reporting).
#  * src/lib/holoo-sync.ts — GetCustPay now sends BOTH documented parameter
#    spellings (`code` per owner spec §4 AND `customerErpCode` per the public
#    TncHoloo clients) with the SAME value, so whichever the real service
#    recognizes yields payments + the authoritative balance refresh. Sync
#    status vocabulary now matches spec §9: a run that COMPLETED with
#    per-section/per-record errors is honestly «partial» (ناقص) instead of
#    «success» — healthy sections keep their data, errors stay listed.
#    holooSyncState() also reports lastSuccess (spec §8: زمان آخرین
#    همگام‌سازی موفق) for the status API + tab. Invoices whose customer
#    left Holoo's active list now resolve their MedPad row via the DURABLE
#    Customer.erpCode link (the no-delete policy keeps both sides) instead
#    of erroring as «no linked customer».
#  * src/app/api/admin/holoo/test/route.ts — the read-only GetCustPay probe
#    now carries a REAL sample code (first ErpCode from the Customer list)
#    plus both parameter spellings, so the owner sees the true response
#    shape with a meaningful parameter on the real service (spec §4).
#  * src/components/panel/HolooTab.tsx — «ناقص» badge for partial runs +
#    the «آخرین همگام‌سازی موفق» line.
